  "job_B9.6.4_20251003_115050": {
    "chunk_text": "wordum gelicum o\u00f0re aldormen & \u00f0\u00e6s cyninges ge\u00feeahteras spr\u00e6can. \u00dea gen to\u00e6tyhte Cefi & cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde Paulinus \u00feone bisceop geornlicor gehyran be \u00feam \u00dea het se cyning swa don. \u00dea he \u00fea his word gehyrde, \u00fea clypode he & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Geare ic \u00feet ongeat, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t nowiht For\u00feon swa micle swa ic geornlicor on \u00feam bigange \u00fe\u00e6t sylfe so\u00f0 sohte, swa ic hit l\u00e6s mette. Nu \u00feonne ic openlice ondette, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feysse lare \u00fe\u00e6t sylfe so\u00f0 scine\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t us m\u00e6g \u00fea gyfe syllan For\u00feon ic \u00feonne nu l\u00e6re, cyning, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t templ & \u00fea wigbedo, \u00fea \u00f0a we buton w\u00e6stmum Ono hw\u00e6t he \u00fea w\u00e6s se cyning openlice ondettende \u00feam biscope & him eallum, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde Mid \u00fey \u00fee he \u00fea se cyning from \u00fe\u00e6m foresprecenan biscope sohte & ahsode heora halignesse, Hwa m\u00e6g \u00fea nu ea\u00f0, \u00fee ic longe mid dysignesse beeode, to bysene o\u00f0erra monna gerisenlecor Ond he \u00f0a sona from him awearp \u00fea idlan dysignesse, \u00fee he \u00e6r beeode, ond \u00feone cyning b\u00e6d For\u00f0on \u00feam biscope heora halignesse ne w\u00e6s alyfed, \u00fe\u00e6t he moste w\u00e6pen wegan, ne elcor buton \u00dea sealde se cyning him sweord, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine mid gyrde; & nom his spere on hond & hleop on \u00dea \u00f0\u00e6t folc hine \u00fea geseah swa gescyrpedne, \u00fea",
